# Kalonlife brand colors

These values are the visual source of truth. Tokens live in `src/styles/brand.css` and `src/styles/colors.css`. Do not introduce other brand colors, and do not revert to the retired teal/mint/yellow palette or the rejected Deep Forest greens (`#0D2818`, `#1B4332`).

| Role | Name | Value |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Primary dark | Brand Dark | `#014750` (`--color-brand-dark`) |
| Accent | Golden Rush gradient | `linear-gradient(135deg, #FFD700 0%, #FF9800 100%)` |
| Neutral | White | `#FFFFFF` |
| Neutral | Light Neutral | `#F7F8F6` |
| Soft | Light Tint | `#EAF2ED` |
| Text | Dark Text | `#16231B` |

- `#014750` is the only dark brand shade: dark sections, footer, legal strip, hero/product overlays, headings, nav text, icons, links. Use it solid; do not add a second dark shade or a dark gradient. Hover on dark buttons uses opacity/shadow, not a new hex.
- White text on `#014750`.
- Golden Rush (`--kl-gradient-golden-rush`) is the primary accent: CTAs, chips, selected states, small labels, icons, accent lines. Use sparingly.
- Golden Rush backgrounds always use `#014750` text. Never white text on Golden Rush.
- `#F7F8F6` for soft section/page backgrounds; `#EAF2ED` sparingly for soft cards, hover, borders.
- `#16231B` for body text. Links: `#014750` default, `#FF9800` hover.
- Cards stay white; do not fill cards with gradients.
- No random blue, purple, pink, or cyan. Error/success semantic colors are exempt.
- Do not use Tailwind; use the token CSS.
